    },
    {
      "card": {
        "bgColor": "var(--gray-3)",
        "icon": "page",
        "label": "Lesson 26 • Promoting An Employee",
        "descriptions": [
          {
            "description": [
              {
                "text": "Steve is meeting with his boss, Kurt, to review his performance. Kurt promotes Steve to the position of marketing director."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Kurt: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Steve, your performance over the past year has been excellent. You've only been here a year, but you "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "hit the ground running"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Steve: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Thank you. It's nice to be appreciated!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Kurt: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "You're an "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "\"A\" player"
                },
                {
                  "text": " here—a real star. You've really "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "earned your keep"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". You're great at motivating your employees, and you're always willing to go the extra mile."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Steve: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Thanks, Kurt. I really enjoy my work here."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Kurt: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "I'm going to "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "take you into my confidence"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". Steve, this past year has been really challenging. Everybody hasn't "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "made the grade"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Steve: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Right. I heard that Dan is going to be "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "given his walking papers"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Kurt: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Yes, he'll be "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "leaving us"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". I'll be "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "breaking the news"
                },
                {
                  "text": " to him this afternoon. But the good news is that I'm promoting you to marketing director."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Steve: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Wow, that is good news. Thank you!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Kurt: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "No need to thank me. You're a real "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "go-getter"
                },
                {
                  "text": ", and you earned it. The new position comes with a 10 percent raise and several perks*, including an extra week of vacation."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Steve: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Will I get a company car too?"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Kurt: "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "Don't push your luck"
                },
                {
                  "text": ". But if you "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "play your cards right"
                },
                {
                  "text": ", maybe in a few years. Ten years "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "down the road"
                },
                {
                  "text": ", I can even see you in a "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "corner office"
                },
                {
                  "text": "."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Steve: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Thanks, Kurt."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "block": [
                {
                  "boldText": "Kurt: "
                },
                {
                  "text": "No, Steve, thank you. "
                },
                {
                  "markedText": "Keep up the good work"
                },
                {
                  "text": "!"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
